! PFILTER removing the lowest 5% and highest 8% in delta, by the percentiles of a copied delta column,
! in two passes on the device (the CPU's swap order each). Must be identical
Q1: QUAD, L=0.1, K1=0.5
D: DRIF, L=0.2
R: RFCA, L=0.1, VOLT=2e6, PHASE=80, FREQ=2.856e9
PF: PFILTER, LOWERFRACTION=0.05, UPPERFRACTION=0.08
BL: LINE=(Q1, D, R, D, PF, D)
